  "SQUALANE":                                  { role: "Barrière", description: "It seems to us that squalane is in fashion and there is a reason for it. Chemically speaking, it is a saturated (no double bonds) hydrocarbon (a molecule consisting only of carbon and hydrogen), meaning that it's anice and stable oily liquidwith a long shelf life." },
